    {
      "id": "1814c39a-8979-4952-93f7-a74eaf2be069",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -736,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 624,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## AI Lead Triage with Human Approval\n\nFor small teams that want Claude to triage inbound leads with a human in the loop - no reply is ever sent automatically.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. A public form collects the lead\n2. Claude classifies it and drafts a suggested reply\n3. A reviewer approves or rejects the draft by email\n4. Approved leads are appended to Google Sheets with the draft for follow-up\n5. Any Claude or parsing failure posts one Slack alert\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Add your Anthropic API key to 'Claude Classify and Draft Reply' (Header Auth, name: x-api-key)\n- [ ] Connect Gmail, Google Sheets, and Slack credentials\n- [ ] Set your spreadsheet ID in 'Log Lead to Google Sheets' (tab: 'Leads')\n- [ ] Set the reviewer address in 'Email Draft to Reviewer'\n- [ ] Publish the form and share its URL\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the classification rubric in the Claude system prompt, change the alert channel in 'Alert - Claude Step Failed', or swap the Sheets log for your CRM node.\n\nSetup time: ~10 minutes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
